<title>USA: UAW, Ford anounce tentative labor contract.</title>
<headline>UAW, Ford anounce tentative labor contract.</headline>
<dateline>DEARBORN, Mich. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co and the United Auto Workers Union said on Monday that they reached a tentative agreement for a new national labor contract.</p>
<p>Ford and UAW officials, at a news conference here, declined to provide details of the pact, but said they expected it to be ratified by September 29.</p>
</text>
